---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Impact"
  description="Public-record numbers HalfCut and its partners publish. Every figure has a citation."
  current="impact"
  
>
<section class="imp-hero" data-screen-label="04 Impact · Hero">
  <span class="topo-bg dark" aria-hidden="true"></span>
  <div class="imp-hero-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Impact Report · FY2026</span>
    <h1>The work,<br>in numbers.</h1>
    <div class="imp-hero-bottom">
      <p class="lede">
        Every figure here is reconciled with our Traditional Owner partners and the public record. We publish the workings because money you can't trace isn't money you can trust.
      </p>
      <div class="meta">
        ACNC registered charity · ABN 24 642 788 814 · Founded 2019
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CINEMATIC 01 — Daintree canopy / place -->
<section class="cinematic h-emerge" data-screen-label="04 Impact · Cinematic 01" aria-label="Daintree canopy">
  <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574482620811-1aa16ffe3c82?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2400&q=85" alt="Daintree rainforest canopy at dawn" loading="lazy">
  <div class="cinematic-cap">
    <div class="words">This is the place. 120 million years of unbroken rainforest, the oldest tropical rainforest on Earth, on Kuku Yalanji Country.</div>
    <div class="meta">Daintree Lowland Rainforest · Wet Tropics World Heritage Area · UNESCO inscribed 1988</div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Hero number -->
<section class="big-num" data-screen-label="04 Impact · Headline">
  <div class="label">Age of the Daintree</div>
  <span class="stat">120<span class="unit">million years</span></span>
  <p>The oldest tropical rainforest on Earth, on Eastern Kuku Yalanji Country. Globally, less than three per cent of original rainforest remains. The work on this page is what it takes to make sure this one keeps standing.</p>
</section>

<!-- AMBIENT editorial slab -->
<section class="ambient" data-screen-label="04 Impact · Ambient 01">
  <div class="ambient-inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Why the numbers matter</span>
    <h2>Every figure on this page is a <span class="acid">hectare bought back</span>, a tree planted, a family returning to Country, and a decision made on Country by the Eastern Kuku Yalanji Bama people.</h2>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Dollar breakdown -->
